    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d197">

                <pb facs="0404" n="146" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg146"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1614</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-20T14:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 20, 1915, 2 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 3.40 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>13. The three Scandinavian countries have sent notes to British and French
                    Governments protesting against the policy of retaliation against Germany in so
                    far as it affects Scandinavian trade and navigation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
